        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 18\" Curved Acrylic Shower Handles</b>\r\n<p>\r\nBring a touch wow to your bath room with this pair of 18\" curved acrylic shower door handles. Available in your choice of <b>5 different Acrylic Colors</b>, in either clear or frosted.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nMix and match the acrylic colors with the bracket finishes to match your bath rooms decor.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions  Curved Acrylic Shower Handles\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle  Overall Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 12\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Cast Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: These acrylic shower door handles are handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including other <b>acrylic colors and bracket finishes</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Packaged with 2 door pull handles and includes the hardware for back to back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Pulls)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "18 Inch Curved Acrylic Shower Handles, Pair, First Impressions SD-CFCRBAxx/18",
                "description": "First Impressions CFCRBA Curved Acrylic Shower Pulls. Pair of 18 inch curved acrylic shower door handles available in 5 different colors of acrylic with your choice of bracket finish options. Mix and match the acrylic colors with the bracket finishes to match your bath rooms decor.",
